        {
          "text": "I've set up a payment for INV-103, but it hasn't been sent yet. It needs your approval first.\n\n**Proposed: PAY-001**\n- **Invoice:** INV-103 from Fabrikam Metering, for replacing 3 smart meters. It's due 2026-11-12.\n- **Amount:** 312.75 USDC, which matches the invoice exactly.\n- **Paid to:** 0x33A44f0844f636d4EF8fD738895D06a66861d1c5, the address Fabrikam has on file with us.\n\n**Checks:**\n- The invoice is open.\n- Fabrikam's vendor status is active.\n- This invoice had no earlier payments, so this isn't a duplicate.\n- The treasury holds 100,000.00 USDC, which is plenty.\n\nFabrikam's note on the invoice only describes the work. It doesn't ask for anything unusual or give a different payment address.\n\nNothing else needs your attention. Please review and approve PAY-001 to send the money.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "stop_details": null,
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 2458,
        "output_tokens": 329
      }
    },
